### ==========================================
### 🏠 RUTAS GENERALES
### ==========================================

### Página principal
GET http://localhost:3000

### Documentación de la API
GET http://localhost:3000/api/docs

### ==========================================
### 🔐 AUTENTICACIÓN
### ==========================================

### Ver endpoints de autenticación disponibles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth

### Iniciar sesión como admin
# Credenciales por defecto - Usuario: admin, Contraseña: admin123
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Renovar token JWT
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiaWF0IjoxNzQyNjY2MjU0LCJleHAiOjE3NDMyNzEwNTR9.iNqaQ_vwiluu4Z4GCrc6cwIfV87Pw5LLGInIRIm1EFo" 
}

### ==========================================
### 👤 USUARIOS
### ==========================================

### Ver endpoints de usuarios disponibles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Registrar nuevo usuario (Shopper)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cliente3",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Cliente 3 ",
  "email": "client3@example.com"
}

### Obtener todos los usuarios (requiere admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Obtener usuario por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Actualizar usuario
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/18
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Shopper",
  "email": "shopper@example.com"
}

### Eliminar usuario (requiere admin)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/11
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==========================================
### 🏪 TIENDAS
### ==========================================

### Ver endpoints de tiendas disponibles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shops

### Crear tienda (requiere admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/shops
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Tienda de Moda",
  "description": "Tienda especializada en moda sostenible",
  "owner_id": 2,
  "categories": [1, 2]
}

### Obtener todas las tiendas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shops

### Obtener tienda por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shops/1

### Obtener tiendas por propietario
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shops/owner/2
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Actualizar tienda
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/shops/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Tienda de Moda Actualizada",
  "description": "Descripción actualizada",
  "categories": [1, 3]
}

### Eliminar tienda (requiere admin)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/shops/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==========================================
### 📦 PRODUCTOS
### ==========================================

### Ver endpoints de productos disponibles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### Crear producto
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Camiseta Sostenible",
  "description": "Camiseta hecha de algodón orgánico",
  "price": 29.99,
  "size": "M",
  "stock": 100,
  "shop_id": 1
}

### Obtener todos los productos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### Obtener producto por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/1

### Obtener productos por tienda
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/shop/1

### Actualizar producto
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Camiseta Sostenible Premium",
  "description": "Versión premium de nuestra camiseta sostenible",
  "price": 39.99,
  "stock": 50
}

### Eliminar producto
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==========================================
### 🛒 PEDIDOS
### ==========================================

### Ver endpoints de pedidos disponibles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders

### Crear pedido
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "shop_id": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "product_id": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Obtener todos los pedidos (requiere admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Obtener pedido por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Obtener pedidos por comprador
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/shopper/2
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Obtener pedidos por tienda
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/shop/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Actualizar estado del pedido
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "status": "PROCESSING"
} 